# Admin (`apps/admin`)

- Keep UI simple: login, dashboard stats, drivers, deliveries, live tracking map.
- Live map is the hero feature: WebSocket → update markers without remounting the map.
- Use TanStack Query for REST; local map marker state can be React state/Redux.
- Memoize marker list updates; avoid re-rendering the full page on every location tick.
- Reuse types from `packages/shared-types` for WS events and delivery statuses.
